**utility.hpp does define non-owning callback references.**

## API
`gamepad::unstable::function_ref<Return(Args...)>`: `function_ref(Callable&&) noexcept`; `Return operator()(Args...) const`.

## Contract
Stores callable address plus erased callback; caller must ensure callable lifetime.